DISCUS Macros in this directory are:


modify.mac             ! modifies a simple structure
symmetry.mac           ! Applies a symmetry operation to a molecule
shear.mac              ! Shears part of the structure
pit.mac                ! Points out insufficient precision for hexagonal crystals

circle.mac             ! Solution to homework  Create a circle
checkerboard.mac       ! Solution to homework  Create a checkerboard crystal

plot.mac               ! Writes a structure for plot with KUPLOT
plotx.mac              ! Writes a structure for plot with XBS
plotcif.mac            ! Writes a structure for plot with JMOL

KUPLOT Macros in this directory are:

kplot.mac              ! Creates a simple structure plot
kplot6.mac             ! creates a simple structure plot, hexagonal case
